116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (The program aims to improve the quality of life of homeless individuals by providing comprehensive care, protection, and opportunities for rehabilitation. Through shelter, nutritious food, healthcare, psychosocial support, skill development, and livelihood opportunities, the initiative helps individuals regain stability, dignity, and self-reliance. The program also facilitates access to government welfare schemes, identity documents, and employment, enabling beneficiaries to successfully reintegrate into society. By adopting a holistic approach, the project seeks to reduce homelessness, prevent social exclusion, and empower individuals to lead safe, independent, and productive lives. We specifically support homeless people with diverse and complex needs, including individuals with mental health challenges, persons with disabilities, terminally ill patients, and elderly people.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
117 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Through compassionate care, medical assistance, counselling, rehabilitation, and access to essential welfare services, Helping Hearts strives to address the diverse and complex needs of homeless individuals. Our support goes beyond providing basic shelter and food, with a focus on ensuring access to regular healthcare, medication, mental health support, personal care, hygiene, and assistance with day-to-day activities. Special attention is given to elderly persons, individuals with mental health challenges, persons with disabilities, and those living with terminal illnesses, who often require continuous and specialized care. We also facilitate access to relevant government welfare schemes and other support services, wherever possible, to help beneficiaries receive the entitlements and assistance available to them.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Our continued efforts are aimed at improving the overall quality of life and well-being of these vulnerable individuals by creating a safe, caring, supportive, and inclusive environment. Through sustained engagement and individualized care, we work to promote their physical and emotional well-being, restore a sense of belonging, and uphold their dignity, self-respect, and right to live with care and respect.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Through collaboration with healthcare providers, government departments, volunteers, donors, and community stakeholders, Helping Hearts continues to strengthen its support systems and ensure that vulnerable individuals are not left behind, enabling them to live with dignity, compassion, and respect.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
