/E (This initiative is designed for individuals who have successfully completed their recovery and rehabilitation but have no family support or safe place to return to. Recognizing that sustainable recovery requires both economic independence and social inclusion, the program provides opportunities for skill development, employment, and community reintegration, enabling beneficiaries to rebuild their lives with dignity and self-reliance.)
/Pg 18 0 R
