274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (The Halfway Home supports individuals who have recovered from mental health challenges by providing vocational training and employment opportunities to help them lead independent and dignified lives. In association with the Tamil Nadu Skill Development initiative, beneficiaries receive training in Catering, Housekeeping, and Security Guard services. Upon successful completion, they are offered employment opportunities within our shelters and upcoming social enterprises, including community canteens and catering services. This initiative promotes financial independence, social reintegration, and a smooth transition from recovery to community living.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
