330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (We are also committed to supporting needy and vulnerable individuals by addressing their basic needs and helping them lead safer, healthier, and more dignified lives. Our welfare initiatives focus on people who face social and economic difficulties and may have limited access to food, shelter, healthcare, education, livelihood opportunities, and essential government services. Through our interventions, we aim to provide timely assistance while also supporting individuals and families in becoming more self-reliant and improving their overall quality of life.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
331 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
