/P 95 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Overall, the programme has contributed to improved access to basic necessities, reduced financial stress, better healthcare access, and enhanced dignity and social inclusion among beneficiaries. Through these continued interventions, Helping Hearts remains committed to ensuring that vulnerable individuals and families receive timely support and are able to navigate difficult circumstances with greater security, care, and dignity.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Healthcare assistance and other essential support have enabled vulnerable individuals to access necessary services with greater ease and dignity. The programme has also strengthened community support by connecting needy people with relevant welfare services and other available resources.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
