342 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The Public Healthcare Access and Support initiative aims to enhance the patient experience and improve access to essential services within government hospital campuses, particularly for economically vulnerable patients and their caregivers. The program provides volunteer assistance to guide patients to the appropriate departments, helping them navigate the hospital system and access timely treatment.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (The initiative seeks to create a more patient-friendly and inclusive healthcare environment by addressing the essential needs of patients and their caregivers during their hospital visits. By reducing practical barriers and improving access to supportive services, the program enhances patient comfort, dignity, and convenience, particularly for economically vulnerable families. These interventions help reduce stress, save time, improve the overall hospital experience, and enable patients and caregivers to focus on timely treatment and recovery while promoting equitable access to quality public healthcare services.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (In addition, the program will implement various welfare activities within the hospital premises, including patient assistance services, health awareness initiatives, distribution of essential items, and support for vulnerable individuals. These interventions aim to create a more patient-friendly, inclusive, and compassionate healthcare environment while improving access to public health services with dignity and care.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
