376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (Thaaimai Koodu \(a lactation room\) is a compassionate CSR initiative envisioned to support lactating mothers receiving care at the Coimbatore Medical College Hospital \(CMCH\). The project aims to provide a dedicated, hygienic, and welcoming space for breastfeeding mothers especially those from underprivileged backgrounds ensuring their comfort, dignity, and privacy during their hospital visit or stay. The project aimed at providing a safe, private, and comfortable space for breastfeeding mothers. This dedicated facility is equipped with essential amenities including proper lighting, a table fan, an exhaust fan for ventilation, feeding pillow, chair and a cradle to support mothers attending to their newborns. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
