/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (The project focuses on providing specialized manpower support for the OP registration process in Coimbatore Medical College Hospital \(CMCH\). In CMCH, the outpatient registration process is essential in ensuring that patients to receive timely response. The project aims to improve patient satisfaction, reduce registration delays. During peak hours, healthcare facilities may experience as urge in patient registrations, which can lead to bottlenecks and increased wait times. Well-trained manpower is essential in managing these high volumes without compromising on service quality.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7]
>>
